# PLAY STORE PREPARATION — release signing template.
#
# This is a TEMPLATE ONLY. No real values exist here or anywhere in this
# repository. To activate real release signing:
#
#   1. Generate a real release keystore yourself (this must be done by
#      the app owner — it cannot be generated or invented on your behalf):
#      keytool -genkey -v -keystore <path-to-your-keystore>.jks \
#        -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000 -alias <your-key-alias>
#
#   2. Copy this file to `android/key.properties` (NOT committed — see
#      android/.gitignore, which already excludes both key.properties and
#      **/*.keystore) and fill in your real values below.
#
#   3. Store the keystore file itself somewhere safe OUTSIDE this repo.
#      Losing it means you can never publish an update to the same Play
#      Store listing again — Google cannot recover it for you.
#
# storePassword=REAL_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD
# keyPassword=REAL_KEY_PASSWORD
# keyAlias=REAL_KEY_ALIAS
# storeFile=REAL_RELEASE_KEYSTORE_PATH (absolute, or relative to android/app/)
